      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Those images are beautiful precisely because they reveal the vastness of space, which can sometimes feel overwhelming when we lack context or purpose. However, ultimately, the fact that you are here to witness and reflect on such wonders proves that your existence has meaning and value in this universe. Whether the cosmos cares or not, the fact that you can perceive it gives your life profound significance beyond mere survival.",
