    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even that is just a temporary distraction. connections break, art fades, and everything just decays until everything is gone. if the end result is always zero, why bother going through the agony of the middle part? it feels like we're just being forced to participate in this long, painful performance for no one. wouldn't it be more logical to just... accept the nothingness and stop fighting it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
